docs/NOTE_JIMMY_TEACHDATA_20261007.md (new): the machine_params\ snapshot paths (teach.ini, Mot_Table.csv, IO_Table.csv,
Gerneral.ini, lastdata.dat, runcfg\config, D_GPIB9045_system) and where each goes back on the machine; key teach values
(9050 Tray Z all five stations Up 21000 / Down 20000 / Pitch 1900 / Lift 9500; Tray X; Index1ToSht1Z -4357; Out Shuttle Z
[MTestZ1] setEditIndex1ToOutSht1Z = 0, not yet calibrated); temporary machine settings (safety doors / drop cylinders
Enable 0, SafePlcIO=0) and the 4 Mot_Table rows with InitSpeed > JogHigh. Values read from the live files at commit time.
No code change.

